{"sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"loginOpaque"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"usernameOrEmail"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"password"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"async"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"throws"},{"kind":"text","text":" -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/LoginResult","preciseIdentifier":"s:8AxiamSDK11LoginResultO","text":"LoginResult"}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"text":"Discussion","type":"heading","anchor":"discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A sibling of ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AxiamClient\/login(email:password:)"},{"text":", not a replacement. It takes the same arguments and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"returns the same ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/LoginResult"},{"text":", MFA branch included, so an application can switch a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"tenant to OPAQUE without touching its own code.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"text":"What this does that `login` does not","type":"heading","anchor":"What-this-does-that-login-does-not"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The password never leaves this process. What crosses the wire is a blinded group element","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and a MAC, neither useful without the account’s registration record ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"and"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" the tenant’s OPRF","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"seed — so a TLS-terminating proxy, an accidentally verbose request log, or a heap dump on","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the server cannot capture a plaintext password, because the server never has one. It also","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"means a stolen record database is not offline-crackable on its own, which is the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"pre-computation resistance SRP could not offer. It does ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"not","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" protect against a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"compromised AXIAM server.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"text":"Swift no longer needs a `pbkdf2_sha256` tenant","type":"heading","anchor":"Swift-no-longer-needs-a-pbkdf2sha256-tenant"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The SRP client this replaces refused an ","type":"text"},{"code":"argon2id","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" tenant outright — Swift has no Argon2","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"that ships on every supported platform, and substituting PBKDF2 would have derived a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"different ","type":"text"},{"code":"x","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and surfaced as “invalid password”. AXIAM’s ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"default","type":"text"}]},{"text":" KDF was, for Swift,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"unreachable. The key stretching now happens inside ","type":"text"},{"code":"libaxiam_opaque_ffi","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", so the only","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"remaining condition is having that library, which ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AxiamClient\/opaqueAvailable()","type":"reference"},{"text":" reports.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"text":"One round trip, and no server-proof step","type":"heading","anchor":"One-round-trip-and-no-server-proof-step"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"SRP had to guess a group before the server named one and restart the exchange if it guessed"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"wrong; "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"KE1"},{"type":"text","text":" does not depend on the key-stretching function. And where the old §23.3 rule 6"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"had to mandate an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"M2"},{"type":"text","text":" check in capitals — because skipping it kept only half the protocol"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"— RFC 9807’s AKE authenticates the server during the handshake, so opening "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"KE2"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"is"}]},{"type":"text","text":" the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"proof that it holds the record."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"text":"Cost","type":"heading","anchor":"Cost"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Runs the tenant’s key-stretching function: Argon2id at 19 MiB and t=2 by default, tens to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"hundreds of milliseconds of CPU plus that memory. That cost is the point — it is what makes","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"a stolen record expensive to attack even by someone holding the OPRF seed. It runs on the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"calling task rather than a shared executor.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"name":"Throws","style":"note","type":"aside","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":""},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AxiamError\/network(_:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" when the tenant has OPAQUE disabled (the endpoint"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"answers "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"404"},{"type":"text","text":" — a property of the tenant, not of any user), when "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"libaxiam_opaque_ffi"},{"type":"text","text":" is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"not installed, and when the server names a key-stretching function this SDK cannot ask"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"for. Deliberately not "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AxiamError\/auth(_:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":": reporting a configuration gap as a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"credential failure would send a user off to reset a password that works, and would stop a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"caller falling back to "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AxiamClient\/login(email:password:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}]},{"name":"Throws","style":"note","type":"aside","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":""},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AxiamError\/auth(_:)"},{"type":"text","text":" for a wrong password, an account that does not exist, and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a server that does not hold the record — indistinguishable by design. "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Nothing is sent"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to "},{"code":"login\/finish","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" in that case"}]},{"type":"text","text":" (§23.4 rule 7), and a caller must not retry over"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AxiamClient\/login(email:password:)"},{"type":"text","text":": that hands the plaintext to an endpoint that just failed to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"prove itself."}]}]}]}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/axiamclient\/loginopaque(usernameoremail:password:)"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"metadata":{"fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"loginOpaque","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"usernameOrEmail","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"password","kind":"externalParam"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"async"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"throws"},{"kind":"text","text":" -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"LoginResult","preciseIdentifier":"s:8AxiamSDK11LoginResultO"}],"roleHeading":"Instance Method","externalID":"s:8AxiamSDK0A6ClientC11loginOpaque15usernameOrEmail8passwordAA11LoginResultOSS_SStYaKF","title":"loginOpaque(usernameOrEmail:password:)","modules":[{"name":"AxiamSDK"}],"symbolKind":"method","role":"symbol"},"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK","doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AxiamClient"]]},"abstract":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"POST \/api\/v1\/auth\/opaque\/login\/start"},{"text":" then ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\/finish"},{"text":" — OPAQUE login, RFC 9807","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(CONTRACT.md §23).","type":"text"}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AxiamClient\/loginOpaque(usernameOrEmail:password:)","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"references":{"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK/AxiamError/network(_:)":{"role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AxiamError\/network(_:)","title":"AxiamError.network(_:)","type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"case"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"network"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"NetworkError","preciseIdentifier":"s:8AxiamSDK12NetworkErrorV"},{"kind":"text","text":")"}],"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"Transport-level failure: connection refused, timeout, TLS error, DNS failure,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"malformed request, server (5xx) error.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/axiamerror\/network(_:)"},"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK/AxiamClient/login(email:password:)":{"abstract":[{"text":"Authenticate with email\/username + password (§1 ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"login"},{"text":").","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","title":"login(email:password:)","url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/axiamclient\/login(email:password:)","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"login","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"email","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"password","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"keyword","text":"async"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"throws"},{"kind":"text","text":" -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"LoginResult","preciseIdentifier":"s:8AxiamSDK11LoginResultO"}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AxiamClient\/login(email:password:)"},"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK/LoginResult":{"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"LoginResult","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"LoginResult","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"text":"Outcome of ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"login"},{"text":" (§1). Tokens are delivered out-of-band via ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"httpOnly"},{"text":" cookies, so no","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"token material appears here.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/loginresult","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/LoginResult","title":"LoginResult"},"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK/AxiamError/auth(_:)":{"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/axiamerror\/auth(_:)","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AxiamError\/auth(_:)","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"Authentication failure: wrong credentials, expired session, MFA failure,","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"or a 401 on the refresh call itself.","type":"text"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"case"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"auth"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"AuthError","preciseIdentifier":"s:8AxiamSDK9AuthErrorV"},{"kind":"text","text":")"}],"type":"topic","title":"AxiamError.auth(_:)"},"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK/AxiamClient":{"abstract":[{"text":"The AXIAM REST client (§1–§7, §9 of CONTRACT.md).","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","title":"AxiamClient","url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/axiamclient","fragments":[{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"AxiamClient","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"AxiamClient","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AxiamClient"},"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK":{"type":"topic","role":"collection","abstract":[{"text":"The official Swift SDK for AXIAM (Access eXtended Identity and Authorization Management).","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK","title":"AxiamSDK"},"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK/AxiamClient/opaqueAvailable()":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Whether this installation can perform OPAQUE (§23.2)."}],"url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/axiamclient\/opaqueavailable()","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AxiamClient\/opaqueAvailable()","title":"opaqueAvailable()","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"opaqueAvailable","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"() -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Bool","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"role":"symbol"},"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK/AxiamClient/loginOpaque(usernameOrEmail:password:)":{"type":"topic","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"loginOpaque","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"usernameOrEmail","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"password","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"async","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"LoginResult","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:8AxiamSDK11LoginResultO"}],"abstract":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"POST \/api\/v1\/auth\/opaque\/login\/start"},{"type":"text","text":" then "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\/finish"},{"type":"text","text":" — OPAQUE login, RFC 9807"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"(CONTRACT.md §23)."}],"url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/axiamclient\/loginopaque(usernameoremail:password:)","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AxiamClie